 Dobrowolski's Theorem 2.1 states that a nonzero complex polynomial $F$ with a zero of modulus 1 satisfies
 
 \[
-L$F$\ge 2M$F$.\tag{D}
+L(F)\ge 2M(F).\tag{D}
 \]
 
